//   2. copies each original to <file>.bak.<timestamp> (cp -p), moves the new file into place (same mode), and installs facetExtras.js.
// Takes effect at the next deals-api restart (idle window, Paul's call). FACET_COND_PRICE stays OFF until someone sets it in the process env.
//
// RESTORE: for each backup the apply printed: cp -p <file>.bak.<STAMP> <file>   (files: deals_api_server.js inventoryListQuery.js); then rm facetExtras.js;
//   then restart only if deals-api was already restarted onto the new code. All at once:
//   cd <dir> && for f in deals_api_server inventoryListQuery; do cp -p $f.js.bak.<STAMP> $f.js; done; rm -f facetExtras.js
